pKa — CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0, NonCommercial ShareAlike  (NovoMCP/novomcp-pka)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The pKa model's primary training set (IUPAC Dissociation Constants) is CC-BY-NC-4.0
(NonCommercial), and it also uses ChEMBL (CC-BY-SA 3.0, ShareAlike); the pKa weights
therefore combine both terms as CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 and are distributed separately,
opt-in via HF_PKA_MODEL_REPO. Trained on:
  IUPAC Dissociation Constants — CC-BY-NC-4.0. Reproduced by permission of the
    International Union of Pure and Applied Chemistry.
    https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7236452
  ChEMBL pKa measurements — CC-BY-SA 3.0. EMBL-EBI, https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chembl/
  Uni-pKa (dwar-iBond microscopic pKa) — Apache-2.0.
    https://github.com/dptech-corp/Uni-pKa
  SAMPL6 / SAMPL7 — validation only (not used to train the weights).

